    "intro_narrative": "You awaken in a neon-drenched, abandoned cybernetics workshop in the underbelly of Neo-Kowloon. The rain beats rhythmically against the grime-covered windows, while holograms flicker erratically in the damp air. The door behind you is magnetically sealed, locked down by an automated corporate security protocol. Your only way out is to use the scattered, half-functioning tech left behind by a rogue hacker. To escape, you must ultimately reactivate the facility's primary matter printer and synthesize a physical bypass key. Unravel the web of encrypted archives, corrupted databanks, and fragmented code strings to reclaim your freedom before the corporate cleanup crew arrives.",
    "narrative_style": "cyberpunk"
